#!/bin/bash
# fly-help — short Fly Lite / Simple-AF install tips and custom commands.
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
Fly-bian / Fly Lite 2.1 — help
==============================

First boot
----------
1. On the FLY-SETUP FAT volume, edit fly-start.txt (Wi-Fi, root, user).
2. Boot the board; wait for resize + Wi-Fi (several minutes).
3. SSH in:  ssh USER@BOARD_IP
4. Run:     fly-start     (guided Simple-AF install / update)
   or:      fly-help      (this text)

Simple-AF (Simple-AF image)
---------------------------
Trees are pre-baked under /opt and copied into your home on first user bind.
Finish printer/probe with either:

  fly-start
  # or manually:
  ~/pellcorp/installer.sh --install --printer <printer> --probe <probe> [--mount <mount>]

Example:
  ~/pellcorp/installer.sh --install --printer creality-k1m-2023 --probe bltouch --mount Default

Update an existing install:
  ~/pellcorp/installer.sh --update
  # or choose "Update Simple AF" in fly-start

Do not install KIAUH on a Simple-AF card (or Simple-AF on a KIAUH card).
Do not install KlipperScreen on this 512 MB board — use GrumpyScreen.

Web UIs (after install)
-----------------------
  Fluidd    http://BOARD_IP/
  Mainsail  http://BOARD_IP:4409
  Camera    http://BOARD_IP/webcam/?action=stream

Custom commands (this image)
----------------------------
  fly-help
      This help text.

  fly-start
      Interactive menu driven by fly-start.txt on FLY-SETUP /boot:
        1) Run Full Install Script  — INSTALL_CMD, then optional cameras
           and GrumpyScreen (AUTO_CAMERAS / INSTALL_BOOT_DISPLAY)
        2) Update Simple AF         — ~/pellcorp/installer.sh --update
        3) Cancel

  fly-crowsnest-add-cams [--dry-run]
      Find USB cameras under /dev/v4l/by-id and append [cam …] sections
      to ~/printer_data/config/crowsnest.conf, then restart Crowsnest.
      Skips the H3 cedrus encoder (/dev/video0).

  fly-grumpy-rotate [0|1|2|3]
      Set GrumpyScreen rotation (0°/90°/180°/270°). Writes
      ~/printer_data/config/grumpyscreen.ini and restarts GrumpyScreen.
      No argument: show current rotation.

  fly-crowsnest-strip-placeholders
      Remove stock [cam web] / /dev/video0 placeholders from a conf file
      (used by the camera helper and image bake).

Image identity
--------------
  /etc/fly-debian/flybian-version   e.g. 0.1
  /etc/fly-debian/flybian-image     e.g. Fly-bian-0.1_Fly-Lite-2.1_Simple-AF

Config file
-----------
  /boot/fly-start.txt   (FLY-SETUP FAT volume; also under first-boot/)
  Keys for fly-start: INSTALL_CMD, AUTO_CAMERAS=Yes|No,
  INSTALL_BOOT_DISPLAY=Yes|No

Serial: 115200 8N1, Type-C. Do not pulse DTR/RTS.
EOF
